3 (Homologation: thioamide + HCN + NH3 \u2192 arginine \u03b1-aminonitrile) [Surface]\n  - rxn_009: mol_013 -> mol_014 (Hydrolysis: arginine \u03b1-aminonitrile \u2192 L-arginine) [Biochemical]\n  - rxn_010: mol_015, mol_023 -> mol_014 (Ornithine guanidination (free Orn): ornithine + cyanamide \u2192 arginine) [Biochemical]\n  - rxn_011: mol_018 -> mol_015 (Hydrothermal ornithine formation: glutamate \u2192 ornithine (speculative nonenzymatic cycle)) [Hydrothermal]\n  - rxn_012: mol_017, mol_004, mol_020 -> mol_018 (Metabolism-like amino acid synthesis: \u03b1-ketoglutarate + NH3 + H2 \u2192 glutamate) [Hydrothermal]\n  - rxn_013: mol_019, mol_020, mol_004 -> mol_015, mol_014 (CO/H2/NH3 surface catalysis: CO + H2 + NH3 \u2192 amino acid mixture incl. ornithine and arginine (low confidence)) [Hydrothermal]\n  - rxn_014: mol_021, mol_022, mol_004 -> mol_014 (Photochemical nitrate-formaldehyde synthesis: NO3- + formaldehyde + NH3 + sunlight + TiO2 \u2192 arginine (speculative/historical)) [Surface]\n  - rxn_015: mol_015, mol_023 -> mol_014 (Ornithine guanidination (post-polymer): peptide-bound ornithine + cyanamide \u2192 arginine residues) [Biochemical]\n  - rxn_016: mol_001 -> mol_023 (Cyanamide formation from HCN dimers (speculative, justified by prebiotic plausibility)) [Surface]\n  - rxn_017: mol_016, mol_004, mol_020 -> mol_015 (Prebiotic ornithine formation (volcanic spark/steam discharge)) [Surface]\n\nPATHWAYS (10):\n  - P1: Cyanosulfidic network (full Patel et al. route) (9 steps)\n  - P2: Ornithine guanidination (free Ornithine) (3 steps)\n  - P3: Ornithine guanidination (post-polymer/peptide) (3 steps)\n  - P4: CO/H2/NH3 high-temperature surface synthesis (Fischer-Tropsch-like) (1 steps)\n  - P5: Nitrate/formaldehyde photochemical route (historical) (1 steps)\n  - P6: Metabolism-like reductive amination to glutamate then speculative extension (4 steps)\n  - P7: Hybrid: Volcanic ornithine, then cyanosulfidic guanidination (3 steps)\n  - P8: Hybrid: CO/H2/NH3