ation of \u03b2-aminopropionitrile (alternative path)\",\n      \"description\": \"One-pot reaction of \u03b2-aminopropionitrile and cyanamide yields Arg \u03b1-aminonitrile, hydrolyzed to Arg.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_001\", \"rxn_002\", \"rxn_018\", \"rxn_008\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_006\", \"mol_016\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P10\",\n      \"name\": \"Hybrid volcanic-surface Ornithine supply and guanidination\",\n      \"description\": \"Volcanogenic Orn generated in hydrothermal/spark scenario, transferred to a pool for cyanamide guanidination.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\"rxn_009\", \"rxn_016\", \"rxn_010\"],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\"mol_019\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hub_molecules\": [\n    \"mol_004\",\n    \"mol_006\",\n    \"mol_008\",\n    \"mol_016\",\n    \"mol_019\",\n    \"mol_026\"\n  ],\n  \"convergence_points\": [\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_019\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\"rxn_009\", \"rxn_013\"],\n      \"outgoing_reactions\": [\"rxn_010\", \"rxn_017\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_016\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\"rxn_007\", \"rxn_018\"],\n      \"outgoing_reactions\": [\"rxn_008\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_026\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\"rxn_016\"],\n      \"outgoing_reactions\": [\"rxn_010\", \"rxn_011\", \"rxn_018\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_004\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\"rxn_001\"],\n      \"outgoing_reactions\": [\"rxn_002\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "parsed_response": {"target_molecule": "Arginine", "overall_strategy": "This network rigorously integrates ALL experimentally supported and plausible prebiotic modules for arginine, specifically: (1) The UV-driven cyanosulfidic protometabolic pathway of Patel et al. (2015), through stepwise C3\u2192C5 aminonitrile/aldehyde, with explicit H, N, and S atom flow, all intermediates, and properly detailed small-molecule accounting; (2) Late-stage guanidina